 "notes": [
  "{{sentTo.maskedEmail}} is filled in by the send step (sentTo.maskedPhone for SMS).",
  "Code posts context key `code`; verify-code-otp-email reads `code` and the login id the send step saved (tmpExternalId), so the code screen needs no email input.",
  "With data-auto-submit true the code field itself is an interaction (id = its props.id) and submits when the last digit is typed: give it a next rule like the Verify button. Drop the prop (and its rule) to submit only with the button.",
  "Every interaction needs a next rule: an unconnected one fails the flow at runtime (NextTaskNotFound).",
  "formNoValidate on Resend skips the required-field check so it works with an empty code.",
  "Ids are console-shaped: screenId \"SC\" + 27 base62 chars, node ids 10-char nanoids equal to props.id. Using this screen twice in one flow: give the copy a new screenId (node ids only need to be unique within a screen)."
 ]
}
